---

This product depends on services and data it does not redistribute.
Anyone running it supplies their own credentials and is bound by those
providers' terms:

  * Google Maps Platform (Places API (New), Routes API, Weather API,
    Maps JavaScript API). Place data is cached under the content-class
    rules in app/services/cache.py - place ids indefinitely, coordinates
    for at most 30 days, everything else in memory only.
  * Duffel (flight search). This project has no ticketing path.
  * SerpApi (Google Hotels). This project has no booking path.
  * OpenAI (the conversational agent and the research tier).
  * Open-Meteo (historical weather reanalysis; no credential required).
